Ghidra project for GalacticDan_8000,ff8 (RISC OS absolute, load/exec &8000)

Open in Ghidra:   File > Open Project > project/GalacticDan.gpr
Rebuild:          ./run_ghidra.sh     (~1 min; overwrites the project)
Re-classify:      python3 export_ghidra.py ../extracted/GalacticDan_8000,ff8 8000 galdan.json
                  (spider.py does recursive descent + speculative gap tracing, ~4 min;
                   result cached in galdan.json.pickle - delete it after editing spider.py)

Language ARM:LE:32:v4 (closest to ARM2/3; 26-bit PSR-in-PC is not modelled).

Conventions in the project:
  sub_XXXX    function reached from the entry point
  spec_XXXX   function found only by speculative tracing (also bookmarked "RISCOS")
  var_XXXX    inline variable in code space (written by str rX,[pc,#...])
  SWI block   at 0x10000000: one pseudo-function per SWI (OS_Byte, Sound_Control, ...),
              linked from each SWI via CALLOTHER_OVERRIDE_CALL; args are r0..rN
  Plate comments mark self-modified instructions and what gets written there.
  Pre comments mark computed jumps into unrolled plotters (switch overrides).

out/galdan.c        decompilation of every function
out/functions.tsv   per-function size / callers / callees / status
